WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'll definitely be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.990
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.870
Ever since I met the fairy-like idol, Futaba Aria-chan, there's been a stream of surprises.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.960
Aria-chan succeeded Hime-senpai as the muse of 
My Little Heart and debuted a Premium Rare Dress.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.290
And with her very first performance, she got Star Wings!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.170
She's soared up the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.760
After that, she enrolled at Venus Ark.{apparently in British it's spelled enrol? also, enroll at an institution, but enroll in a program}

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.680
Having a new friend is gonna make everything more fun.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.890
I'll Aikatsu hard with everyone and aim to become the world's brightest star!

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.950
Mother! Mother!

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.080
What did you think of my show?

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.080
You were fabulous, Elza.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:09.630
Forte-sama.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.550
It is time for your appointment with the Countess. {that's so weird}

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.720
I see... Thank you.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.310
I'll be looking forward to your next one.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:32.650
This must be... because I am not yet perfect.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.300
<i>Just a bit more...</i>

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.430
<i>Just a bit more until I can reach the Sun Dress.</i>

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.970
<i>And once I do, I'm certain that she will...</i>

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.660
Today's steak comes from a cut of Tajima beef.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.490
Please enjoy it along with the avocado wasabi sauce.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.370
Steak for breakfast!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.340
This sauce has a nice sting to it!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.500
It's Japanese wasabi.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.630
Aria, have you adjusted to life at Venus Ark yet?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:07.260
Yes! It's a lot of fun getting to 
experience a variety of Aikatsu here.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:12.560
Kirara's making sure to be a good, 
supportive senpai to her, Elza-sama!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.850
That's splendid.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.280
Ladies, do be aware that Forte-sama will be visiting today. {this feels awful to type. I think it's because I've been doing Kujira, a show where we remove honorifics}{this reminds me of Forte from RF4}

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:26.990
She has made some time in her worldwide expedition to come.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.660
Who is Forte-sama?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.250
My mother.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:41.670
A Lady of the Monaco royal family, Yukie Grace Forte, 
has made a sudden appearance in Japan.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.470
She simply radiates beauty.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.890
Lady Forte is in fact the mother of Elza Forte-san.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.430
What? You mean Perfect Elza?

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.900
In addition, it appears that she herself was once a world-renowned top idol.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:02.530
And in her acting career, every movie she starred in became a huge hit.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.820
She was also the first idol in history to found her own brand.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.580
I believe she has devoted herself to philanthropy since her retirement.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:17.080
Some may even call her the Perfect Mother of Aikatsu itself.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:17.080
Wow, so Elza-san's mother was an idol too.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.710
The dress shown in those photos was incredible.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.380
I wonder what brand it's from.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.300
I sure would love to meet a world-renowned idol!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.760
You may just get that opportunity. I heard she's coming to Venus Ark.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:32.970
Really?!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.180
Okay, I'll go and see!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:35.980
Huh?!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.150
I want to check up on Aria-chan too.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.480
Now that you mention it, she did enroll at Venus Ark.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.730
Do you have enough time?

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.610
It's just a quick stop before work!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.300
I'm pleased to see you again, Mother.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.130
Good day, Elza.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.930
So that's Elza-san's mom. She's pretty.{yume, glasses are for seeing}

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.640
Oh, Yume-chan!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.730
Hi, Aria-chan! How have you been?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.400
Very good. Every day is fulfilling.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.560
Oh? And you are?

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.230
Yume Nijino?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:28.860
It's a pleasure to meet you! 
I'm Nijino Yume from Four Star Academy. {but to iimasu}

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.280
Good day.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.620
Four Star Academy is a famous idol school.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:41.670
She also spent a period studying here at Venus Ark.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.880
My, how fortunate.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:47.090
In that case, please present an invitation to Nijino-san.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:47.970
At once.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.800
We are holding a party tonight.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:58.770
I would love to hear what Aikatsu 
Elza and her friends have been up to.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.850
Please consider attending.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.190
I will! Thank you very much!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.920
<i>Not good enough.</i>

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.180
<i>To create the greatest Premium Rare Dress...</i>

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.260
<i>...a fire must be lit in my heart.</i>

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.690
Understood. I'll see you after, then.{she says the same line to her mother later, it might important or it might not but}{I'm 98% sure not, but I am proud}

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.940
Where is your mother?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:46.940
Rei.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:52.070
She left to attend to some business. She'll be back this evening.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.780
I haven't known her long, but she's truly a perfect lady.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.620
She is.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:05.250
I began my Aikatsu and created 
Venus Ark due to my mother's influence.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.210
She also sparked my desire to obtain the Sun Dress.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.550
Rei, there is something I would like to share with you alone.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:17.930
What?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.780
These are... {I don't understand the surprise}

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.340
Star Premium Rare Coords.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.840
Thus far, eight pairs of Star Wings have appeared.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:01.470
My Venus, Lily's Pluto, Kirara's Mercury.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:07.150
Mahiru is Neptune, Rola is Mars, and Yuzu is Saturn.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:11.730
And then there is Yume's Earth and Aria's Jupiter.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.070
Only one remains.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:21.040
When all nine Star Wings have gathered, the Sun Dress will come forth.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:26.170
The dress of miracles shining from the peak of the universe, able to illuminate any darkness.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.670
Precisely.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:33.340
Still, what relation does your mother have to the Sun Dress?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.170
Look at this.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.640
This is the Sun Dress.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:41.220
My mother was once the bearer of the Sun Dress.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.730
I wanted to be like her,

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.940
and so I swore to obtain the Sun Dress.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:58.070
My mother, beautiful and perfect as the sun, was my aspiration.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:05.200
I improved myself in various ways since childhood in order to be like her.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:11.790
However, she was always busy with one thing or another, flying all around the world.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:18.260
Whether it be for her philanthropy or to attend a conference.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:24.270
My desire to see her brought me to the videos of her time as an idol.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:29.140
<i>If I can be perfect, just like Mother,</i>

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:34.610
<i>I'm sure she'll come and hug me!</i>

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:41.030
What should I do to become a perfect idol like you were?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.160
Let me think.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:47.580
Look, this is the Sun Dress.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:53.540
I could only get it after I was 
acknowledged as a perfect top idol.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.670
I'm sure it would suit you wonderfully.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.510
The Sun Dress...

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:10.640
Ever since then, my sole goal has been to obtain the Sun Dress.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:18.030
It is said that the Sun Dress will only appear once all nine Star Wings have gathered.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:25.870
However, nobody can say for certain which of the nine bearers of Star Wings it will appear before.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:30.790
But no matter what, it will be mine.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.340
By my word—

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:40.300
I vow to obtain the final Star Wings.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.520
Rei-chan!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.150
Hey, about today's party...

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.780
I've never seen Rei-chan look that serious before.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.030
How lovely!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.500
Everything is a new level of gorgeous than usual. {I feel like they're underdressed}

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:15.500
N-Not bad, I must admit.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:16.920
Yume-chan!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.670
Aria-chan.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.840
You all came together!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:27.260
Yes, I have a few choice words for Elza-san's mother.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.470
Like what?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:35.980
"Are you aware that your daughter is playing 'idol pirate', sailing around pillaging all the brands she wants?{I don't remember but isn't "idol pirate" something that other people call her?}{yeah I tried to sneak it past}

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:40.860
Just how did you raise her?!"

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:42.570
Like that!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.900
That gets me going!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.410
I'll tell her what for!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.160
May I have a moment?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.370
I would like to thank you for providing Elza company.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.420
Please enjoy a pleasant evening under the stars.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.630
Cheers.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.420
Cheers!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.510
How interesting. So all of you were at Venus Ark.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.800
Yes, we spent a time studying abroad here.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:12.060
I hope you were all able to enjoy your Aikatsu along with Elza.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:10.100
Go on, let her have it.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.060
I will, okay?!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.650
Listen here, okay? {I'm finding it extremely difficult to do this, please help}

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:24.740
Elza-chan always treats me so purrleasantly!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.070
You gave up too fast!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.950
Ako-chan's as cute as always.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.200
I'm gonna go grab a drink.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:33.910
Sure!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.210
It's been a while.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.800
Elza-san. Hello.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.680
How have you been since leaving?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:55.730
Looking at you reminds me of how Rei was when we first met.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.230
You are like a soulless rock star.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.610
You have no passion.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.030
Yes, it's those eyes.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.660
I knew there was fire in them.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.790
What are you trying to say?

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.160
Oh, nothing really.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:20.420
I simply thought you were putting it to waste. Good day.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:29.430
I'm sorry. Elza has a habit of igniting the fighting spirit of those around her.{fighting spirit!}{fighting fighting!}

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.760
I can tell what you just thought.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.810
"She makes me mad. I definitely won't lose to Elza."

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.440
Isn't it intriguing?

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:46.150
Did something happen, Rola?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.400
There are wrinkles on your forehead. {i.e. she's scowling}{fine}

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.660
Elza must have said something.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.700
It's fine! She was completely right.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.420
Since Elza-san came, I've been motivated in more ways than one.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.380
I must say I was too.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:07.670
I also feel like I was allowed to grow a lot at Venus Ark.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.050
Thank you.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:16.560
Elza is blessed to have been able to Aikatsu alongside you all.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.310
Forte-sama.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.690
Excellent, thank you.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:30.070
In anticipation of meeting so many of you idols, 
I've prepared a humble present.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.740
A present?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.830
Attention, everyone. Are your hearts ready?{similarly clunky, but less not not not}

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:44.710
I will cast a magic spell and bring forth wonder.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.090
What's happening?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.090
What kind of magic?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.840
You'll just have to wait and see.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.590
Three.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.340
Two.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.720
One.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.860
What's happening?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.490
The lights...{rip patients in surgery?}

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.120
Wow...

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.090
It's so pretty!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.760
There are so many stars!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:41.640
When you darken all our surroundings, even the smallest stars are visible!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:47.940
Living in such a bright world can sometimes hide them from view.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:54.360
The ideals, dreams, and glimmering stars you were inspired to chase.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:17:02.910
I made a special request today to prepare a short reverie of true darkness for you.{I feel like I'm using this wrong but whatever}{it's uh, fine I think}

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:12.670
Please use it to recall your own dreams and stars of ideals.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:24.690
I'll be concluding the night with 
a performance for our guests shortly.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.440
Of course, I'm excited for it as well.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.610
Well then, I'll see you after.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.480
Okay.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.070
Forte-sama.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.630
The Blooming Queen Coord.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.000
Dresses strengthen me!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.360
For I am perfect!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.660
Elza-sama, you were awesome like usual! {I didn't want to repeat that}

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.420
I was very excited watching your show too!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:18.790
And my mother?

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:23.300
I'm afraid she was called in for urgent business.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.050
She had to leave before your show.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.680
I see. The same as always.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.450
<i>I am not yet perfect.{or "I am not yet perfect"}</i>

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:57.250
<i>Once I obtain the Sun Dress and become a perfect idol...</i>

00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:59.880
<i>Then finally...</i>

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:19.600
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:23:55.830 --> 00:24:00.540
The starry sky brought an even greater gleam to your wings.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.370
You were truly perfect.

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:04.920
Dresses strengthen me.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:09.300
Only the Sun Dress can grant my wish. Just watch!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.880
Down with Venus Ark!

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:14.800
We'll achieve it no matter what!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.510
With our grab-bag plan!{lyger hyphen but}

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:19.560
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.230
Halloween Surprise.

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:23.520
Become the first-star idol!
